{%- comment -%}
  The Buy 2 Get 1 site banner — one slim crimson strip above the header.

  Rendered from layout/theme.liquid, in flow BEFORE the header group, rather
  than living in the marquee or announcement sections — on this store all
  three of those bars are switched OFF in the header group, and re-enabling
  one just to carry this message would resurrect its old content with it
  ("BLACKOUT Sale Is Live" is still sitting in the marquee blocks). It must
  not be rendered from inside sections/header.liquid either — that was tried:
  the theme's sticky machinery puts position: sticky on the whole
  .header-section, so anything inside is carried down the page with the
  header and paints over the docked collection rail. Out in the layout the
  strip shows once at the top and scrolls away, and no sticky offset has to
  know it exists. A strip that hangs off onrepeat-b2g1-on cannot leak: on the
  published theme it renders nothing until the merchant ticks the checkbox.

  Static, not scrolling. It carries one message; the marquee engine earns its
  keep when there are three. It also scrolls away with the page rather than
  pinning — the offer re-asserts itself on the PDP and in the cart, which are
  the two places the decision actually happens, so the banner does not need
  to shadow the shopper down the page.

  Ignores the header's colour scheme on purpose: brand crimson with the gold
  FREE is the offer's livery on every surface (PDP chip, meter fill), and the
  banner is the same object at page scale.

  Usage (already wired):
    {%- render 'onrepeat-b2g1-banner' -%}   ← layout/theme.liquid, before 'header-group'
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture b2g1_banner_on -%}{%- render 'onrepeat-b2g1-on' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if b2g1_banner_on != blank -%}
  <style>
    .onrepeat-b2g1-banner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #5c1011;
      color: #f5efe6;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .onrepeat-b2g1-banner em {
      font-style: normal;
      color: #caa15a;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .onrepeat-b2g1-banner svg { flex: 0 0 auto; opacity: 0.85; }
  </style>
  <div class="onrepeat-b2g1-banner" role="region" aria-label="Offer">
    <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12v10H4V12M2 7h20v5H2zM12 22V7M12 7a3 3 0 1 1 3-3c0 2-3 3-3 3zM12 7a3 3 0 1 0-3-3c0 2 3 3 3 3z"/></svg>
    <span>Buy 2, get 1 <em>free</em></span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
